<info>
<title>Example: Primary school renovation and extension - OpenBEP requirements for Revit</title>
<version>Fingerprint 9C37B605B3A9 · OpenBEP parameter list v0.1</version>
<description>Generated by the OpenBEP Builder for checking a Revit model, or a model exported from Revit, by Revit category and Revit parameter. Every property is in the property set &quot;Revit&quot;: Category is the Revit category name, the other names are Revit parameter names as Revit shows them (instance first, then the type). One specification per element type at its target LOD (handover target, or the final design target), plus the extra requirements of structural walls.</description>
<date>2026-11-20</date>
</info>
